    "snippet": "Jun 9, 2015         If I try to move name, the compiler will give me an error: cannot move out of name because it is borrowed.That is simple enough, but let us take it a step further. Suppose we wanted to get back the length of the trimmed string from within our scope. If we do that inside our curly braces, then trimmed_name_len will no longer exist once we leave that scope.   Summarize",
